    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Nominalizations",
     "texto": [
      "**Peng-..-an** forms nouns related to an action or its result: **mengambil** → **pengambilan**, **menggunakan** → **penggunaan**. The exact meaning depends on the context.",
      "A solid opinion presents a position, a reason and, if possible, an objection that has been answered."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
